3	/**
4	 * Sitewave (Marketing Agency) — admin server actions. PHASE 1.
5	 *
6	 * Every action re-checks requireArea("platform"). Guardrails, per the build
7	 * plan: NOTHING here scrapes a live site, sends outreach, or provisions a real
8	 * subdomain. "Generate demo" runs the pure generator + deterministic renderer;
9	 * "Deploy to subdomain" only marks a demo DEPLOYED_STUB and records the intended
10	 * host; "Send to outreach" creates/links a Cold Email Business+Contact but sends
11	 * nothing.
12	 */
13	
